glossary.definition:
(a) "Tort action" includes all of the following:

(i) A product liability claim for damages for injury or loss to person or property that is subject to sections 2307.71 to 2307.80 of the Revised Code;

(ii) A civil action based on an unlawful discriminatory practice relating to employment brought under section 4112.052 of the Revised Code;

(iii) A civil action brought under section 4112.14 of the Revised Code.
